# What the parser and the table make of different frames: a v3 report on a
# tagged VLAN (a join, then a leave by a TO_INCLUDE record with no sources),
# a query (its port becomes a router port, recorded and not programmed), a
# corrupted frame (a zeroed IP checksum) and a frame for a
# link-local group, which gets no state.
0 policy
snooping=1
igmp_function=0
immediate_leave=1
end
0 tick
1 v3join 1 14 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
2 query 1 0 192.168.1.1
3 v3leave 1 14 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
4 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 224.0.0.251
5 rx 01000001005e0000010200000000010800460000200000000001020000c0a8010ae0000001940400001100ee9b00000000
6 state
